[72.63,"o","pass\r\nsandbox-guard: cargo reads `/private/tmp/claude-501/rune-proof-27441-exempt-tool-is-the-whole-command-other-tools-are-never-refused-and-a-chain-gets-advice-manifest-under-a-configured-checkout-1160bee8-57-0/c/.cargo/config.toml` from the current directory, not from the manifest, so this call does not see its `build.target-dir` and fills /private/tmp/claude-501/rune-proof-27441-exempt-tool-is-the-whole-command-other-tools-are-never-refused-and-a-chain-gets-advice-manifest-under-a-configured-checkout-1160bee8-57-0/c/ws/target with a private build. Run `cd /private/tmp/claude-501/rune-proof-27441-exempt-tool-is-the-whole-command-other-tools-are-never-refused-and-a-chain-gets-advice-manifest-under-a-configured-checkout-1160bee8-57-0/c/ws && cargo build` instead, without `--manifest-path`: the configured target directory applies only from there.\r\n"]
